OL,3,GNEWSACall for Burnham to remove bus
OL,4,A'postcode lottery'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport campaigners in the South are
OL,7,Furging the prime minister to visit the
OL,8,Fregion to see for himself how rural
OL,9,Fareas are struggling with limited bus
OL,10,Fservices.
OL,12,FSusan Dorsett is leader of
OL,13,FHampshire-based group the Knightwood
OL,14,FValley Park Campaigners, and called on
OL,15,FAndy Burnham to invest in the region's
OL,16,Fbus services like he has in the north.
OL,18,FShe is calling on the PM to nationalise
OL,19,Fbus services in a bid to remove "the
OL,20,Fpostcode lottery" at national level.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
