OL,3,GNEWSACall for Burnham to remove bus
OL,4,A'postcode lottery'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham previously said it would be
OL,7,F"devastating" if people lost access to
OL,8,Fcrucial bus services, and Labour has
OL,9,Fannounced plans to bring franchises
OL,10,Funder the closer control of local
OL,11,Fauthorities.
